  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog Android SDK's dd-sdk-android-webview module: WebViewTracking.Enable, which bridges RUM events and logs out of a WebView so a hybrid app's web content reports into the same session as its native screens. Built against dd-sdk-android 3.12.1. Opt-in; the web page must itself be instrumented with the Datadog Browser SDK.",
